{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","name_native":"Sünen-i İbn Mace","section":{"6":"Chapters Regarding Funerals"},"section_detail":{"6":{"hadithnumber_first":1433,"hadithnumber_last":1637,"arabicnumber_first":1433,"arabicnumber_last":1637,"name_native":"Cenazeler Kitabı"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1575,"arabicnumber":1575,"text":"İbn-i Abbas (r.a.)'dan şöyle demiştir: Resulullah (Sallallahu Aleyhi ve Sellem), kabirleri ziyaret eden kadınları la'netlemiştir. Diğer tahric: Ebu Davud, Nesai ve Hakim de rivayet etmişlerdir. AÇIKLAMA 1576’da","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Hasan Lighairihi"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":6,"hadith":143}}]}